### 🔥 Bonus: Unakku doubt varum ">= D" ஏன்? (உதாரணம்: Digit 7, N=29)

- `29/10 = 2` (7, 17).
- `29%10 = 9`. 9 >= 7 → True → +1 (27).
- Total 3 (7, 17, 27). 
